{"id":"m0fwfbhzj2whdu9is9x178q7h","title":"从写错先贤的名字说起","originalTitle":null,"summary":"文庙中孔子弟子南宫适的牌位被误写为“南宫適”。实际上，“适”和“適”是两个不同的汉字，简化字与繁体字的关系并非一一对应。文章强调在书写繁体字时需谨慎，避免写错。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=612874&do=blog&id=1560072"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-07T00:14:44.092Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-07T00:14:44.092Z","category":null,"tags":["研究成果"],"score":26,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}